@base = http://localhost:8000
@token = REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_TOKEN

### Submit after uploading a private PDF and replacing UUID
POST {{base}}/api/claims
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: sample-claim-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policy_reference": "POL-001",
  "amount": "100.00",
  "incident_date": "2026-11-01",
  "description": "Hospital expenses after an accident",
  "document_ids": ["REPLACE_WITH_DOCUMENT_UUID"]
}

### List owned claims
GET {{base}}/api/claims
Authorization: Token {{token}}
